{
 "duration": 27.353,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ben has climbed 23 of New Hampshire's 48 four-thousand-footers.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.898
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask him which ones, and he scrolls through four years of blurry summit photos.",
   "start": 5.348,
   "end": 9.981
  },
  {
   "text": "Dates, routes, who was there, all gone.",
   "start": 10.431,
   "end": 12.328
  },
  {
   "text": "So his sister printed him a logbook.",
   "start": 12.778,
   "end": 14.762
  },
  {
   "text": "One board to color in, one card for every peak: route, times, weather, who came along.",
   "start": 15.212,
   "end": 20.554
  },
  {
   "text": "Last weekend he filled in number 24 at the trailhead.",
   "start": 21.004,
   "end": 24.396
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for the peak bagger on your gift list.",
   "start": 24.846,
   "end": 27.153
  }
 ],
